UID: REF4-006
TITLE: Bounded nonlinear backward-Euler stepping
STATEMENT: >>>
The reference engine shall solve diode transient requests with a backward-Euler residual and analytic Jacobian, retain the prior accepted state until convergence, and enforce the existing bounded Newton policy.
