[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REF4-018
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Representable recovery progress and final correction verification
STATEMENT: >>>
Source and Gmin recovery shall detect increments lost to floating-point rounding before repeating identical stages. A Newton correction budget shall permit verification of the last allowed correction without allowing another provider call. Recoverable singular/numerical source-stage failures shall preserve rejected-work accounting and nominal final excitation.
<<<
